1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,266
Two agents, two worktrees, one file.

2
00:00:02,266 --> 00:00:04,595
Both pull requests pass against main.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,928
Merge one, and the other breaks.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,037
This is Bullpen.

5
00:00:11,037 --> 00:00:12,917
Source control for AI agents.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,476
One ask.

7
00:00:15,476 --> 00:00:17,676
The orchestrator splits it into three

8
00:00:17,676 --> 00:00:19,757
tasks for three Claude Code agents.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,633
Two agents want auth.ts.

10
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:25,538
The first takes a live lock.

11
00:00:25,538 --> 00:00:27,512
The second waits at the door.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,144
The database folder is guarded, so

13
00:00:32,144 --> 00:00:33,720
the referee asks a human.

14
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,242
Denied: the agent writes a plan instead.

15
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,844
Don't like one agent's work?

16
00:00:40,844 --> 00:00:42,292
Undo that agent alone.

17
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:43,873
The others keep working.

18
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,055
Happy with another?

19
00:00:48,055 --> 00:00:49,555
Open its building, read the

20
00:00:49,555 --> 00:00:50,721
real diff, and merge.

21
00:00:50,721 --> 00:00:53,053
The other branches sync with main at once.

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,210
Under the pixels, everything is real.

23
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,420
Agents lock a file before every edit,

24
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,809
and each lock expires in ninety seconds.

25
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,281
The referee runs on a

26
00:01:04,281 --> 00:01:06,172
Jetson the agents cannot reach.

27
00:01:06,172 --> 00:01:08,552
On-device models write the history, and

28
00:01:08,552 --> 00:01:10,504
a secret guard scans every diff.

29
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,987
Unplug it, and every edit is denied.

30
00:01:13,987 --> 00:01:15,146
Bullpen fails closed.

31
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,831
Every edit is a commit, tagged with

32
00:01:18,831 --> 00:01:21,080
its agent, on your own Claude subscription.

33
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,283
Git tracks what changed.

34
00:01:24,283 --> 00:01:26,635
Bullpen controls who's allowed to change it.
